s attitude and attire change based on your growing influence.<br>    \u2022 Multiple endings await based on your level of dominance.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Maximize Your Massage Session]</h2>    \u2022 Each body part allows for 15 minutes of massage time.<br>    \u2022 Time decreases with each action you perform.<br>    \u2022 Different techniques affect the heroine's emotional gauge.<br>    \u2022 Her reactions evolve as your relationship deepens, turning initial reluctance into acceptance.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122900/extras/26ca5b5756b63729bead662da63941dd.avif?t=1752639363\" width=614 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[Stunning Visuals and Smooth Animations]</h2>    \u2022 Features 420 unique facial expressions for the heroine.<br>    \u2022 Utilizes Live2D technology for fluid, lifelike movements during massages.<br>    \u2022 Immerse yourself in the heroine's ever-changing expressions \u2013 a key highlight of the game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3122900/extras/98483dd862e0baf6c30aac453b18399a.avif?t=1752639363\" width=614 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Indulge in this tantalizing game of revenge and seduction. Will you succeed in turning your former bully into your willing pet?</h2>",
